  "live_verification": "Intrinsic set and signatures captured from 'fish list intrinsics' on live MPoint3D 9.7 (2026-09-14): 100 mpoint.* intrinsics. Every one of the 67 names in the installed out_fish.txt index is present; mpoint.node.mass.mult is live-only. State-grade spot-checks on a 512-point model: mpoint.pos/vol/density/stress.zz/prop and mpoint.node.pos/spacing/stress.zz/mass.mult all returned values consistent with the model that produced them."
